   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The experience particle 过",
     "texto": [
      "**过** after the verb shows that someone has done or experienced something at some point: **去过中国** = have been to China. It doesn't say when it happened.",
      "**了** usually presents an action as completed or a specific change; **过** talks about accumulated experience. The tone of the particle **过** is neutral, unlike the verb **过** («to cross»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
